  "body": "Whether you're stepping onto the property ladder, looking for a smart investment, downsizing or simply searching for a place to call your own, 9B Kenneth Hopper Place could be the one that ticks all your boxes! Our owners have lived their life here but life dictates it's time for an upsize and this home must be sold. \r\n\r\nTucked away in a peaceful Manly cul-de-sac, this inviting three-bedroom home combines comfortable living with a relaxed coastal lifestyle. With light-filled spaces, a generous sunny deck, a private backyard and plenty of room for everyday life, it's an opportunity that will appeal to buyers at all ages and stages.\r\n\r\nHere are some of the features we think you'll love:\r\n\r\n- Three well-proportioned bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation for family, guests or flatmates, with flexibility to suit your needs.\r\n- Spacious open-plan living and dining creates a welcoming heart to the home, filled with natural light and complemented by a heat pump for year-round comfort.\r\n- A practical kitchen is conveniently positioned alongside the living area to keep everyone connected.\r\n- A generous elevated deck extends your living outdoors, overlooking the neighbouring tennis courts and providing the\r\nperfect spot for morning coffees, summer barbecues or entertaining friends.\r\n- A private backyard framed by established hedging offers a wonderful green space for children, pets or simply enjoying the outdoors, with plenty of scope to make it your own.\r\n- A substantial garage and covered parking area beneath the home provide excellent storage and versatility, with room for bikes, tools, hobbies and all the extras that come with everyday life.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location! Manly is a fantastic place to call home, with a welcoming community and so much to enjoy right on your doorstep. Edith Hopper Park, with its sports fields and playground, is just moments away, while Whangaparaoa Primary School is within walking distance. Manly Village, local cafes and shops are all within easy reach, and beautiful beaches, coastal walks and the convenience of Whangaparaoa Town Centre complete the picture, making everyday living that little bit easier.\r\n\r\nComfort, convenience, outdoor space and a location you'll love. How many boxes does this cutie tick for you? Call Tyler Broughton or Brooke Kennedy for more details or come along to one of our weekend open homes and see for yourself. This could be the one!\r\n\r\nOrewa: Auction: 4:00pm, Thursday 19th November 2026 In Rooms, Ray White Orewa, (unless sold prior). You can watch the auction live here https://rwcarpenterrealty.co.nz/watch-our-auctions-live",
